OL,3,GNEWSAMotion to ditch city's 'sanctuary'
OL,4,Astatus defeated
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Reform UK motion to withdraw Bradford
OL,7,Ffrom its City of Sanctuary status has
OL,8,Fbeen defeated by one vote.
OL,10,FThe accreditation was awarded in 2021
OL,11,Fin recognition of Bradford's commitment
OL,12,Fto welcoming and supporting refugees,
OL,13,Fasylum seekers and migrants.
OL,15,FThe Reform motion argued City of
OL,16,FSanctuary was "a political movement"
OL,17,Fthough acknowledged pulling out of the
OL,18,Fscheme would not have any impact on how
OL,19,Fmany refugees and asylum seekers the
OL,20,Fcity took in.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,382,380,200,160,0,100
