OL,3,GNEWSAMotion to ditch city's 'sanctuary'
OL,4,Astatus defeated
OL,5,
OL,6,FOpposition councillors called a
OL,7,Fwithdrawal "divisive", adding it would
OL,8,Fmake "no difference" to the council's
OL,9,Ffinances or the services it provides.
OL,10,FThe motion was defeated by 38 votes to
OL,11,F37.
